    "title": "Cabot referee back on the court after cardiac arrest incident at basketball game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyre White ,\n7 hours ago LITTLE ROCK, AR (KATV) — What started as a regular high school basketball game in Cabot quickly turned into a life or death emergency when a referee collapsed on the court after suffering cardiac arrest. Nosakhere Holcomb was officiating a Cabot girls Junior Varsity basketball game in November when... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
